  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will enable the embassy to support with activities on the further development of the combi-track when needed. Activities can be gathered under economic diplomacy and alignment, communication and promotion, logistics, and networking. The embassy may support or organize activities, involving public and/or private players, Dutch and/or Kenyan as long as these are in support of the combi-track agenda.</narrative>
